<p>Life is just a dream. Be a kite dancing in a hurricane. A metaphor about life - something is dangerous, like a storm that readily destroys our fragile hopes. Don’t be against it; dance with it.</p>
<p><strong>Lê Quang Tiến</strong> - <em>2022-08-12</em></p>



